This file covers the parts that are not software — the hand-written editorial
judgement and the dated record of what the radar has observed. They took
judgement and elapsed time to produce rather than an afternoon of typing, and
they are what this project is actually worth, so they carry attribution.

Covered by this licence
-----------------------

    config/taxonomy.json      19 business verticals x 46 technologies, with a
                              hand-written justification for every pairing in
                              both English and Arabic
    config/publishers.json    the curated publisher reputation tiers
    config/sources.json       the source set and its per-source filters
    data/ledger.json          the dated record of when this radar first saw
                              each item
    content/examples/**       one dated brief and one dated plan match, kept as
